  "name": "Inn-Sane: the Rest buff from drinking restores no mana outside a rest area",
  "contract": "Issue #11278. Drinking applies Rest 818011, whose OBS_MOD_POWER tick restores a percentage of maximum mana. Inn-Sane's NO_MANA_REGENERATION_UNLESS_RESTED rule must hold that tick as it holds the drink itself, so a trial character drinking outdoors keeps its mana. The trial character is level 59 because reaching the level-60 cap completes the trial. A level 60 character without the trial drinking at the same spot regains mana, and the trial character regains mana after entering the Goldshire inn through its real area trigger.",
